    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Napoleonic Wars meet...ducks?</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duckoleon is calling you into battle! Barrage your opponents with cannon and musket fire, Get up close and personal with bayonets, sabres and cavalry, play military instruments like drums or the fife and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775510/extras/c9e567bf099fc877f75b7972015ae42e.poster.avif?t=1755731162\" width=800 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775510/extras/c9e567bf099fc877f75b7972015ae42e.webm?t=1755731162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775510/extras/c9e567bf099fc877f75b7972015ae42e.mp4?t=1755731162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME IS STILL EARLY IN DEVELOPMENT! THERE'S A LOT MORE CONTENT ON THE WAY, THESE ARE ONLY EARLY ACCESS FEATURES!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutliple nations  to choose from:</strong> France, Prussia, Great Britain, Habsburg empire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of regiments from the Napoleonic Wars</strong> with beautiful uniforms and flags!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different soldier classes with special abilities:</strong>\u00a0fusiliers, grenadiers, light infantry, cavalry ranging from lancers to hussars, artillery, sappers, musical instruments...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple maps inspired by the Napoleonic wars</strong> like Waterloo, Austerlitz and Liepzig!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Napoleonic Wars meet...ducks?</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duckoleon is calling you into battle! Barrage your opponents with cannon and musket fire, Get up close and personal with bayonets, sabres and cavalry, play military instruments like drums or the fife and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775510/extras/c9e567bf099fc877f75b7972015ae42e.poster.avif?t=1755731162\" width=800 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775510/extras/c9e567bf099fc877f75b7972015ae42e.webm?t=1755731162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775510/extras/c9e567bf099fc877f75b7972015ae42e.mp4?t=1755731162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME IS STILL EARLY IN DEVELOPMENT! THERE'S A LOT MORE CONTENT ON THE WAY, THESE ARE ONLY EARLY ACCESS FEATURES!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutliple nations  to choose from:</strong> France, Prussia, Great Britain, Habsburg empire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of regiments from the Napoleonic Wars</strong> with beautiful uniforms and flags!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different soldier classes with special abilities:</strong>\u00a0fusiliers, grenadiers, light infantry, cavalry ranging from lancers to hussars, artillery, sappers, musical instruments...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple maps inspired by the Napoleonic wars</strong> like Waterloo, Austerlitz and Liepzig!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Experience (mildly) accurate historical battles from the Napoleonic era, but from the perspective of DUCKS! Duckoleon is a multiplayer FPS with strategic elements. Exciting combat with units ranging from line infantry to cavalry and artillery, historical uniforms, cutie ducks and much more!",
